# Vren's third ability counts every creature exiled under an opponent's control this turn, however it was exiled, not only those its
# own replacement exiled. Bot1 casts Vren on turn 1 (four Moxen) and on turn 3 casts Swords to Plowshares on Bot2's Llanowar Elves, which is
# exiled outright (Bot2 gains 1 life). At the end step Bot1 gets one Rat, 2/2 beside Vren.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Vren, the Relentless
Swords to Plowshares
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Vren, the Relentless.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Llanowar Elves
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Life = 21
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Rat Token.Toughness = 2
